# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Written into a release by CI (see .github/workflows/release.yml). A working
# checkout has no VERSION and reports "dev". Committing one would make every
# dev machine claim to be a release, and the updater compares this string
# against the tag it staged to decide whether a deploy actually took effect.
VERSION

# Uploaded files, never source. `documents_root` defaults to `LEM Web Server/
# data/`, so a --dev run and any test that exercises an upload leaves real
# PDFs here. They are somebody's certificate on a real deploy and a test
# fixture in a checkout; neither belongs in git, and committing them once
# would put lab documents in the history permanently.
LEM Web Server/data/documents/
LEM Web Server/data/standard-certificates/
# The local copy of lem_machine_log. Regenerable in about a second from
# LabCore, which stays the record; committing it would put months of lab
# activity in the history and go stale immediately.
LEM Web Server/data/log-mirror.sqlite3*
